        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Node Classes\n\nThe node classes the editor and the starter templates use.\n\n**Systems.** The Declaration and Markdown classes the editor itself relies on, and the Collection and Repo classes behind the shelves.\n\n**Think.** Decisions, ideas, and learning a topic.\n\n**Plan.** Aims, phases, steps, milestones, risks and constraints.\n\n**Tell.** Stories and the people in them.\n\nThis graph is a collection. Each tile is a portal it contains, and what a tile shows (its name, its description, how many pieces it has) is read from the graph behind it, so nothing here is a copy."
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1791502752029,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
